## Overview
This report summarizes quality control, clustering, cell type annotation,
differential expression, and pathway enrichment analysis of scRNA-seq data.

## Methods
- Seurat-based QC, normalization, PCA, clustering, and UMAP
- Marker-based cell type annotation
- Differential expression using Wilcoxon rank-sum test
- GSEA using clusterProfiler

